= UnderTree manuscript

This manuscript is an ordinary Typst text file. Open this folder in UnderTree,
select a passage, and choose a color rule to guide an agent's review.

== A review that keeps you in control

Protected highlights prevent agent proposals. Other highlights can carry an
instruction such as "Keep the content, but make this paragraph snappier."
Suggestions appear beside the source and remain separate until you accept them.

The project and its small review sidecar can be committed to GitHub while local
editing and Typst compilation remain available offline.
